<h1>Baum Welch algorithm</h1>
<p>
(algorithm)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
An algorithm to find <a href="hiddenMarkovModel.html"><em>hidden Markov model</em></a> parameters A, B, and &Pi; with the maximum likelihood of generating the given symbol sequence in the observation vector.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Aggregate child</strong> (... is a part of or used in me.)<br>
<a href="hiddenMarkovModel.html"><em>hidden Markov model</em></a>.
</p>
<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="viterbiAlgorithm.html"><em>Viterbi algorithm</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
Contributed by Arvind &lt;<a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d7a2bc88b6a5a1beb9b397bab6bebbf9a2a3b2afb6a4f9b2b3a2">[email&#160;protected]</a>&gt; May 2002.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

